{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2021-11", "window": 2, "start_date": 1636329600, "end_date": 1637020799, "month_true_total": 214, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 21:55:56 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "102828094", "author": {"steamid": "76561198828282675", "personaname": "jweaver4174", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198828282675/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 612, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 366, "last_played": 1637851392, "avatar": "285d38cb7e710c885836e3fea0e628f6c571fc74"}, "language": "english", "review": "great game, love the mass effect series.", "timestamp_created": 1636989219, "timestamp_updated": 1636989219, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "102827182", "author": {"steamid": "76561198329639773", "personaname": "appian4", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/appian4/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 32, "playtime_forever": 10471, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1468, "last_played": 1662033693, "avatar": "b86eaf5429659e6cd9cb3a13ee23cc19c27f4553"}, "language": "english", "review": "A good balance between action and RPG, with an interesting storyline and excellent image and sound. Some drama and some humour in the mix.  Although the dialogue usually has limited effect on the game, it can help you romance NP characters, and there are some strategic choices and moral dilemmas that seem more substantial. Combat presents the right level of challenge at various levels, and the dynamics of exploration are usually very satisfying. With so many perks, it is not too difficult a game, and I found that rather than simply try to power up the character, the most fun is try out different weapons, companions and profiles.", "timestamp_created": 1636987981, "timestamp_updated": 1637341488, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "102809701", "author": {"steamid": "76561198071501440", "personaname": "Nanoha Takamachi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198071501440/", "num_games_owned": 263, "num_reviews": 43, "playtime_forever": 2310, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2105, "last_played": 1750764538, "avatar": "f97e32a5325b3985ba95787307233625e3a076b3"}, "language": "english", "review": "Overall a great Mass effect game imo, bit of goofiness here and there but it could have been patched out with time it's just it wasn't given much of it, no game breaking bugs as I was playing it, most if not all of the humor landed for me, all the characters were fun and interesting and I liked the story too, I'd say temper your expectations this isn't the ME Trilogy and more importantly this is one game not three.", "timestamp_created": 1636953657, "timestamp_updated": 1636953657, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.527559041976928711", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "102784508", "author": {"steamid": "76561198082536566", "personaname": "Nemo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198082536566/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 68, "playtime_forever": 3149, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3149, "last_played": 1636841446, "avatar": "1cd0ff6f087762bbb9513c1493ed55f68ae4175e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Really enjoyed it.", "timestamp_created": 1636912297, "timestamp_updated": 1636912297, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.497737526893615723", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "102773278", "author": {"steamid": "76561198011778207", "personaname": "DetroitDylan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/DetroitDylan/", "num_games_owned": 516, "num_reviews": 131, "playtime_forever": 225, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 225, "last_played": 1666757877, "avatar": "51e19ccbd9e92138cd8dfb3c09fc9c30fb11b34a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Compared to MA 1-3 Its a less story driven, less diverse decision tree with a steep hike up on graphics. Shorter story 1/2 the length with 1/4 the side missions it seems more closed off and isolated then the previous titles. This being said the graphics take quite a leap. Nostalgia vs immersion.", "timestamp_created": 1636898779, "timestamp_updated": 1760503138, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.502262413501739502", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}]}